# Confirmed:
# .gitignore -> 1 (no extension)
# .hidden.txt -> 2.txt (extension .txt)
# file.txt -> 3.txt (extension .txt)

# So the extension logic:
# For the FILENAME (last component of path):
# - If filename starts with "." and there's no other "." -> no extension
# - Otherwise -> last "." onwards is the extension

# This matches Rust's Path::extension() behavior

